@doc """
Standard `Convert` trait declaration.
`Convert<$To>` models infallible conversion from `Self` into `$To`.
Choose the target with an explicit ReturnTypeArgument such as `to::<String>(value)`.
Because `to(...)` is part of the shared conversion surface, this trait is
auto-imported when the standard prelude is loaded.

## REPL
xldr(1)> to::<String>(42)
"42"
"""
@autoimport
deftrait Convert<$To> {
  # Convert the source value into the requested target type.
  def to::<$To>(self: Self) -> $To
}
